The Nordiheimian departments of Economy and Foreign Relations, with the permision of the Council of Nordiheim, would like to reach out to [nation]Coober pedi[/nation] in a diplomatic capacity;
They are wondering if the nation would be interested in creating a formal deal of trade and diplomacy between themselfs and Nordiheim for the benefit of both.

They hope for a answer of some kind in the near future.
